{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_13111.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_150.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":2,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story06","chara":[{"id":102001,"motion":401}],"nameRight":"Kagome","textBg":"shout","textRight":"ARU-CHAN!!","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":300601,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Emiri","textLeft":"[chara:300601:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]Wawa—!!@Y-you scared me..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_140.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":301}],"nameRight":"Kagome","textRight":"I'm so sorry...!@I rushed over here..."},{"nameCenter":"Aru-chan's Voice","textCenter":"＜…………＞"},{"chara":[{"id":102001,"motion":201}],"nameRight":"Kagome","textRight":"Aru-chan...!! Hang in there...!!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Emiri","textLeft":"I didn't do a thing to her, but she just like@stopped moving."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_150.exp3.json","id":102001}],"nameCenter":"Hinano's Voice","textCenter":"Emiri, are you safe!?"},{"nameCenter":"Emiri & Kagome","textCenter":"...!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300601},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102001}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":1},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":0,"pos":2}]},{"autoTurnLast":0.3,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300901},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300301},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300201}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_150.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":101,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Kagome","textRight":"Everyone...!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Emiri","textLeft":"It's Myaako-senpai! Sup!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":102001,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"I heard Aru-chan was captured,"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"so I figured if we gathered up everyone@who interacted with her,"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"we could maybe find out the cause of all this."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_110.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":201}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"So that's what this is about...@Thank you so much."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"So, how is Aru-chan?"},{"chara":[{"id":102001,"motion":2}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"She seems to have collapsed after losing her magic,"},{"chara":[{"id":102001}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"so if I give her my magic she should be back@to moving again."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":200,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Emiri","textLeft":"Thank goodness! Then when she opens her eyes@she'll be good as new."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"No, not necessarily."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"When she wakes up she may still not normal,@you know?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_140.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":301,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"There is that possibility, yes."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"Alright, let's assume she's not back to normal@and get our stories straight."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"We might learn something new here."},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"I'm positive the first place she was encountered@was Manaka's place, correct?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Manaka","textLeft":"Yes..."},{"autoTurnLast":1.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"I see...","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"She started at Manaka's, messing around with@turnips and onions..."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"After that she showed up at my chemistry club,@erasing the \"gon\" from \"Argon\" on the periodic@table there."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"Then after that, she appeared by Natsuki's location@and started throwing splitter balls at her."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"And here she lies at last, using the last of her@strength at the consultation office..."},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":200}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"That's everything we know for the time being...?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300301}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":300,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_140.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":2,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"None of it makes sense..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_130.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":301}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"Uu....I really am so sorry..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Emiri","textLeft":"This is seriously beyond cryptic. My head's spinning@trying to make sense of it."},{"chara":[{"id":300901,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"Is this because of a Witch like we first thought?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300601},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":300,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"It's hard to say for sure, but she HAS only been@going after Magical Girls."},{"chara":[{"id":300201}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"I only got a light injury from it,"},{"chara":[{"id":300201}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"but you realize it could get a lot worse@from here on, right?"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"There's no Witch's Kiss to be found on her,@so I don't think that's the case, but..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":300301,"pos":2}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_140.exp3.json","id":102001,"motion":201,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"If not, then is there another reason...?"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"What could it be..."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"Maybe there's a method for the Witch@to control her..."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"...that we just haven't learned of yet."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_130.exp3.json","id":102001,"lipSynch":0,"motion":301}],"nameLeft":"Kagome","textLeft":"…………"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
